<title>USA: Nissan December US vehicle sales fall.</title>
<headline>Nissan December US vehicle sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			Dec 1-31, 1996     Dec 1-31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    20,117	    22,164	     -9.2</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  14,067	    12,485	    +12.7</p>
<p> Import Car		12,602	    13,641	     -7.6</p>
<p> Import Truck	     8,089	     6,695	    +20.8</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Dec 31, 1996 Jan 1-Dec 31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   308,891	   308,089	     -0.4</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 173,717	   180,712	     -4.5</p>
<p> Import Car	     193,469	   212,169	     -9.4</p>
<p> Import Truck	    73,686	    69,934	     +4.7</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 308 for year to date vs 306 in year ago.</p>
</text>
